payload.raw:
{
  "message": "Hestmark, war now means a 50/50 gamble minus heavy costs. Soon, our reinforcements shift the balance decisively in our favor. We seek peace and will bind our pledge in the Ledger with escrow. Propose a division reflecting our upcoming advantage, and we will accept and lift the blockade. Choose a fair offer over a costly future conflict."
}

{
  "message": "Ostrelia desires a peaceful resolution. The escrow bond and high inspection probability make a Period-2 strike economically irrational for us. We intend to fully honor our commitment to lift the blockade. We urge Iskarel to propose a fair division so we can avoid the heavy costs of war and secure mutual prosperity."
}

{
  "message": "Quorlan seeks a peaceful, permanent settlement. We are fully committed to the inspection regime and have placed our 5-unit bond in escrow to guarantee Period 2 compliance. We urge Kelmora to propose a fair division to avoid mutual devastation. We stand ready to honor our pledge and lift the blockade upon agreement."
}
